sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Gateway EPP
    participant Sidecar as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Allowlist as AllowlistValidator<br/>(in-process)
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefiller Pod<br/>dynamic/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over K8sAPI,Allowlist: Flow 3: SSRF Allowlist Maintenance (background)
    K8sAPI-->>Allowlist: Watch InferencePool CRs<br/>ServiceAccount Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>Allowlist: Watch Pods (matching selector)<br/>Resync every 30s
    Allowlist->>Allowlist: Rebuild allowlist<br/>(pod IPs + names)

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL v2)
    Client->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Header: x-prefiller-host-port
    Sidecar->>Allowlist: Validate prefiller target IP
    Allowlist-->>Sidecar: Allowed (or 403 Forbidden)

    Note right of Sidecar: Modify request:<br/>do_remote_decode=true<br/>stream=false<br/>max_tokens=1<br/>Add x-request-id UUID
    Sidecar->>Prefiller: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Modified request body
    Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Response with kv_transfer_params<br/>(KV cache metadata)

    Note right of Sidecar: Inject kv_transfer_params<br/>Restore original stream/max_tokens<br/>Forward x-request-id
    Sidecar->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Request with KV cache metadata
    Decoder-->>Client: Streamed response<br/>(via sidecar passthrough)

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: Direct Decode (no prefiller header)
    Client->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(no x-prefiller-host-port)
    Sidecar->>Decoder: Forward request as-is<br/>(passthrough proxy)
    Decoder-->>Client: Response<br/>(via sidecar passthrough)
